From 8124123820af98dfe4a9feb866565f0717cdea5f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CachyOS Packaging Team <admin@cachyos.org>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 18:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ms178: fix GCC 16 diagnostics and source-level robustness

Backport the pam_winbind configuration matching and password-message
fixes from upstream commits 5bc9de278021 and 2778bdb33080. Replace
deprecated Linux-PAM erasure macros with Samba explicit zeroing.

Make the NFS quota path const-correct and fix its debug path. Harden
registry VK serialization against invalid inputs, allocation failure and
integer overflow; this also resolves the GCC 16 LTO stringop-overflow
diagnostic. Do not build uninstalled examples that use only the
deprecated process-global libsmbclient API.
